Z||000000||Jay||06-01-2001||07:47 PM||||My wife and I have been to several Fiero fests and shows over the past 6 years and I noticed something.  Me and my wife are one of only a handful of Black or ethnic people that own a Fiero and show it or belong to a club.  Thought I would throw this out there and ask if anyone on the forum is ethnic. Or even better...where are your ancestors from?  Don't want to start a whole race riot here, just thought it would help in putting a face to the names.  I'm from Southern Italy (with North African and Arabic mixed in there) from a region called Calabria (It's the southern most part of the boot without going to the Island of Sicily).  My wife was born in Granada W.I. but grew up in Trinidad & Tobago  West Indies (The furthest Islands south in the Carribean, across from Venezuela) before coming to Canada.  Anyone else want to share?<P><P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/kick.gif">  <BR>THE NORTHSTAR GIVES YOU A REAL KICK IN THE ASS!!!||||reg||1
